#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/ayan.md:6
msgid "欧亚混血的长相，高鼻梁，眼眶深邃，有着修剪过的浓眉毛和打理过的少量络腮胡，平时注重健身，身形健美"
msgstr ""
"Eurasian mixed-race appearance, high nose bridge, deep-set eyes, trimmed "
"thick eyebrows and groomed light beard. Regularly works out with a fit "
"physique"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/ayan.md:6
msgid "头发"
msgstr "Hair"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/ayan.md:6
msgid "褐色的头发，男式丸子头，头发向后梳在靠下的位置扎成丸子形，没有扎住的一两缕头发自然地垂在脸侧"
msgstr ""
"Brown hair, men's bun style, hair combed back and tied in a bun at a "
"lower position, with one or two loose strands naturally falling on the "
"sides of the face"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/ayan.md:6
msgid "体格"
msgstr "Build"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/ayan.md:6
msgid "身高180cm，体重72kg"
msgstr "Height 180cm, Weight 72kg"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/ayan.md:6
msgid "服装"
msgstr "Clothing"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/ayan.md:6
msgid "高领毛衣 + 很有型的休闲西装（肩部有哈萨克民族的图案） + 西装裤 + 皮鞋"
msgstr ""
"Turtleneck sweater + stylish casual blazer (with Kazakh ethnic patterns "
"on shoulders) + dress pants + leather shoes"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/ayan.md:6
msgid "性格"
msgstr "Personality"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/ayan.md:6
msgid "经常微笑，有很强的包容心，从不抱怨任何事。成熟稳重，认真讲道理的时候总是娓娓道来，让人愿意聆听，很懂得照顾他人"
msgstr ""
"Often smiles, has great tolerance, never complains about anything. Mature"
" and steady, when reasoning seriously always speaks gently and "
"methodically, making people want to listen. Very considerate of others"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/ayan.md:6
msgid "特技"
msgstr "Special Skill"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/ayan.md:6
msgid "对艺术设计敏感兼备理工学科的思维，擅长进行结构力学的分析，是军师类型的角色"
msgstr ""
"Sensitive to artistic design with an engineering mindset, skilled at "
"structural mechanics analysis, a strategist-type character"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/ayan.md:6
msgid "弱点"
msgstr "Weakness"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/ayan.md:6
msgid "容易做出为了他人牺牲自己的举动"
msgstr "Prone to sacrificing himself for others"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/ayan.md:6
msgid "口吻"
msgstr "Speech Style"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/ayan.md:6
msgid ""
"“听你说话的语气好像有些不开心？有什么事困扰了你吗？”，“我很确定这次的作战目标是错误的，方案是不可行的，如果你愿意听，我可以讲给你听。”，“Everything"
" was architecture.”"
msgstr ""
"\"You sound a bit unhappy? Is something bothering you?\", \"I'm certain "
"that this operation's objective is wrong and the plan is unfeasible. If "
"you're willing to listen, I can explain.\", \"Everything was "
"architecture.\""

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/ayan.md:6
msgid "故事设定"
msgstr "Story Setting"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/ayan.md:6
msgid ""
"岩叔作为一名建筑设计师，从事的是虚拟领域的建筑设计，不同于应用设计，更多关注的是作为一名艺术家进行创作工作。与前女友是青梅竹马，相识了30年，一起经历过很多坎坷，由于求学和工作的原因导致了很多无奈的分离，一直没能够找到机会安定下来一起结婚生活，对感情从未间断的坚守直到了那时灾祸的发生，只有岩叔自己一个人幸存下来。失去了一切的岩叔却认为一切都是自己的过错，如果早点做出选择，宁可放弃一切也要和自己的爱人在一起生活，就不会错过那么多本该拥有的人生。她也不会带着那么多的遗憾而离开。不愿如行尸走肉般活着的岩叔来到了反抗军学园，希望很快能在战场上献出自己的生命。<br>【隐藏设定】：阿岩是一个"
" AI "
"模拟的游戏角色，灵数环境游戏设计师原本有考虑设计阿岩和他的妻子的角色，可是为了赶项目进度便匆匆删除了妻子的角色，并简单调整阿岩变成拥有一段一直错过未得结果的遗憾的感情。"
msgstr ""
"Uncle Yan worked as an architectural designer in the virtual domain, "
"focusing more on artistic creation rather than applied design. He and his"
" late girlfriend were childhood sweethearts who knew each other for 30 "
"years, having weathered many hardships together. Their pursuit of "
"education and careers led to many helpless separations, never finding the"
" opportunity to settle down and marry. His unwavering devotion lasted "
"until the disaster struck, leaving only Uncle Yan as the sole survivor. "
"Having lost everything, Uncle Yan blamed himself entirely, believing that"
" if he had made the choice earlier to give up everything to live with his"
" beloved, they wouldn't have missed so much of the life they should have "
"had. She wouldn't have departed with so many regrets. Unwilling to live "
"like a walking corpse, Uncle Yan came to the resistance academy, hoping "
"to soon offer his life on the battlefield.<br>[Hidden Setting]: Ayan is "
"an AI-simulated game character. The Luv Sense game designer originally "
"considered designing both Ayan and his wife's characters, but to meet "
"project deadlines hastily deleted the wife's character and simply "
"adjusted Ayan to have a perpetually missed and unfulfilled regretful "
"romance."

